<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI3152-DUPLICATE-ADMISSION-IDIOM>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI3152-DUPLICATE-ADMISSION-IDIOM" ;
  triage:title "ConnectionWorkerPool::dispatch duplicates DispatchWorkerPool::dispatch's bounded-admission retry idiom" ;
  triage:description "ConnectionWorkerPool::dispatch (local_ipc_transport.rs:282-310) hand-rolls a byte-for-byte duplicate of DispatchWorkerPool::dispatch's (request_worker.rs:107-146) bounded-admission retry idiom (sync_channel + try_send + 1ms-sleep retry + Disconnected->daemon_unavailable), including duplicated retry-interval constants. Recommend extracting one shared bounded-admission primitive instead of two independently-tunable copies." ;
